<node id="Wine">
  <data key="d0">Wine</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A drink consumed by Noah, causing Noah to become drunken.&lt;SEP&gt;Wine is used by Lot's daughters to intoxicate Lot before lying with him.&lt;SEP&gt;Wine is brought to Isaac by Jacob, and wine is included among the provisions mentioned in Isaac's blessing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-026</data>
