  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The life-bearing substance that people are forbidden to eat as flesh and for which accountability is required when shed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
