<node id="Heth">
  <data key="d0">Heth</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Heth is identified as a child of Canaan.&lt;SEP&gt;Heth is the ancestor of the people whose sons sold the field containing Machpelah to Abraham.&lt;SEP&gt;Heth is the ancestor identified with the family group called the daughters of Heth.&lt;SEP&gt;Heth is represented by the children of Heth, from whom the field and cave were purchased.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-053</data>
