  <data key="d0">Amorite</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Amorite is identified as one of the groups descended from Canaan.&lt;SEP&gt;The Amorite is identified as the source from whom Jacob took a portion using his sword and bow.</data>
