  <data key="d2">An associate of Abram who was identified as the brother of Mamre and Eshcol.&lt;SEP&gt;Aner is one of the men who went with Abram and is designated to receive a portion of the recovered goods.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-012</data>
