<node id="Dan">
  <data key="d0">Dan</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A place to which Abram pursued the forces that captured Lot.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan was Bilhah's first son with Jacob.&lt;SEP&gt;A son of Jacob and Bilhah.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan was Jacob's son and the father of Hushim.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan is Jacob’s son who is associated with judging his people and is symbolized as a serpent or adder.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-053</data>
