<node id="Kadesh">
  <data key="d0">Kadesh</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">A place identified in the text as Enmishpat.&lt;SEP&gt;A location identified as one endpoint of the area between which Beerlahairoi lies.&lt;SEP&gt;Kadesh is a location between which Abraham dwells while journeying through the south country.&lt;SEP&gt;Kadesh is a place near which Abraham journeys while traveling toward the south country.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-017</data>
