<node id="Seed of Abram">
  <data key="d0">Seed of Abram</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The seed of Abram represents Abram’s future descendants, who are promised inheritance, nationhood, and a future return to the land.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-012</data>
