</node>
<node id="Righteousness">
  <data key="d0">Righteousness</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Righteousness is the status counted to Abram because Abram believes in the LORD.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1790121376</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Land of Canaan">
  <data key="d0">Land of Canaan</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The land of Canaan is the land where Abram dwells and the territory promised by the LORD to Abram and Abram’s seed.&lt;SEP&gt;The land of Canaan is the land where Hebron is located and where Abraham dwells among the Canaanites.&lt;SEP&gt;The land of Canaan is where Jacob and his household live and where the brothers return with corn.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-045</data>
