<node id="Bethuel">
  <data key="d0">Bethuel</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Bethuel was a son of Milcah and Nahor and the father of Rebekah.&lt;SEP&gt;Rebekah's father and Nahor's son who agrees with Laban that Rebekah may become Isaac's wife.&lt;SEP&gt;The son of Milcah and Nahor and the father of Rebekah.&lt;SEP&gt;Bethuel is Rebekah's father and a Syrian from Padanaram.&lt;SEP&gt;Bethuel is Rebekah's father and Laban's father.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-027</data>
