<node id="Midian">
  <data key="d0">Midian</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Midian is a son of Abraham and Keturah and the father of Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abidah, and Eldaah.&lt;SEP&gt;Midian is the people or territory that Hadad defeated in the field of Moab.&lt;SEP&gt;Midian was smitten by Hadad in the field of Moab.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-038</data>
