<node id="Shuah">
  <data key="d0">Shuah</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Shuah is a son of Abraham and Keturah.&lt;SEP&gt;Shuah was Judah's wife, a Canaanite woman, and the mother of Er, Onan, and Shelah; Shuah later died.&lt;SEP&gt;Shuah is identified as the parent of Judah's deceased wife.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-040</data>
