<node id="Padanaram">
  <data key="d0">Padanaram</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Padanaram is the region associated with Bethuel and Rebekah's family.&lt;SEP&gt;Padanaram is the region to which Isaac sends Jacob to obtain a wife from Laban's family.&lt;SEP&gt;Padanaram was the place where Jacob acquired cattle and goods.&lt;SEP&gt;Padanaram is the place from which Jacob comes before arriving at Shalem.&lt;SEP&gt;A land associated with Jacob's sons and with Jacob's departure before God blessed Jacob.&lt;SEP&gt;Padanaram is the place where Leah bears children to Jacob.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-049</data>
