<node id="Philistines">
  <data key="d0">Philistines</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Philistines are the people associated with Gerar who envied Isaac, stopped Abraham's wells, and disputed Isaac's access to water.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1790121384</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Edom">
  <data key="d0">Edom</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Edom is the name given to Esau because of his request for the red pottage.&lt;SEP&gt;Edom was the country identified with the land of Seir.&lt;SEP&gt;The name associated with Esau.&lt;SEP&gt;Edom is the land associated with Esau and the territory where Edomite rulers reigned.&lt;SEP&gt;Edom was the land of possession associated with the dukes descended from Esau.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-038</data>
  <data key="d4">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1790121384</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Birthright">
  <data key="d0">Birthright</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The birthright is Esau's inheritance privilege, which Esau sold to Jacob after swearing to the agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;The birthright is an inheritance privilege that Esau says Jacob previously took from him.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-026</data>
  <data key="d4">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1790121384</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pottage">
  <data key="d0">Pottage</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Pottage is the lentil dish that Jacob prepared and gave to Esau in exchange for Esau's birthright.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1790121384</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Esek">
  <data key="d0">Esek</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Esek is the name Isaac gave to a well over which the herdmen of Gerar and Isaac's herdmen contended.&lt;SEP&gt;A well named Esek because people strove over it.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1790121384</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sitnah">
  <data key="d0">Sitnah</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sitnah is the name Isaac gave to a second well over which the parties contended.&lt;SEP&gt;A well over which people strove after it was dug.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1790121384</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Herdmen Of Gerar">
  <data key="d0">Herdmen Of Gerar</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The herdmen of Gerar are herders who disputed Isaac's herdmen over ownership of water from a well.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1790121384</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Isaac's Servants">
  <data key="d0">Isaac's Servants</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Isaac's servants dug wells in the valley of Gerar and found springing water.&lt;SEP&gt;Isaac's attendants who dug a well and later reported finding water.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-025</data>
