<node id="Bashemath">
  <data key="d0">Bashemath</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Esau's wife and daughter of Elon the Hittite.&lt;SEP&gt;Ishmael's daughter, sister of Nebajoth, and a wife of Esau who bore Reuel.&lt;SEP&gt;Bashemath is Esau's wife and the mother of Reuel.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-037</data>
