  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Jobab is the son of Zerah of Bozrah and a king who reigned in Edom after Bela.&lt;SEP&gt;Jobab was the son of Zerah and a ruler who succeeded Bela.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-038</data>
