  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Hadad is the son of Bedad, a king of Edom who succeeded Husham and defeated Midian in the field of Moab.&lt;SEP&gt;Hadad was the son of Bedad, a ruler who succeeded Husham, and the person who smote Midian in the field of Moab.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-038</data>
