</edge>
<edge source="God" target="Isaac">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">God establishes an everlasting covenant with Isaac and Isaac's descendants and promises Isaac's birth.&lt;SEP&gt;God promised Isaac as the son of Abraham and Sarah and established an everlasting covenant with Isaac and Isaac's descendants.&lt;SEP&gt;God commands Abraham to circumcise Isaac when Isaac is eight days old.&lt;SEP&gt;God is identified as the God of Isaac, and Jacob swore by the fear of Isaac.&lt;SEP&gt;God had given land to Isaac as part of the land later promised to Jacob and Jacob's descendants.&lt;SEP&gt;Isaac is described as one of Jacob's fathers who walked before God.&lt;SEP&gt;God is described as having sworn an oath to Isaac concerning the future land of the children of Israel.</data>
