<edge source="Abram" target="Sarai">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Abram identifies Sarai as his wife and asks her to present herself as his sister to protect Abram in Egypt.&lt;SEP&gt;Abram traveled with Sarai from Haran into the land of Canaan.&lt;SEP&gt;Sarai asks Abram to go in to Hagar so that Sarai may obtain children through Hagar.&lt;SEP&gt;Sarai is identified as Abram’s wife.</data>
  <data key="d9">family,household arrangement,marriage,protection,request,travel</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-012</data>
