<edge source="Abraham's Servant" target="Rebekah">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Abraham's servant identifies Rebekah as the intended bride, negotiates her departure, and brings her toward Isaac.&lt;SEP&gt;Abraham's servant meets Rebekah at the well and identifies her as the woman appointed for Isaac based on her response to his request for water.&lt;SEP&gt;Rebekah gives Abraham's servant water and draws water for all his camels.&lt;SEP&gt;Abraham's servant encountered Rebekah in the field and identified Isaac as the servant's master.</data>
  <data key="d9">encounter,hospitality,identification,marriage arrangement,marriage selection,service,travel</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d11">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1790121408</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
