<edge source="Egypt" target="Joseph">
  <data key="d7">8.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Egypt–Joseph relationship describes Joseph’s arrival in Egypt, where he was brought down to the country and ultimately placed by Pharaoh over all its land. Acting under Pharaoh’s authority, Joseph governed and administered Egypt during the coming years, becoming governor and exercising rule throughout the country.

During his administration, Joseph bought all the land of Egypt for Pharaoh and established a levy over it. He later invited his family to come and live in Egypt. Joseph himself lived there, and his sons Manasseh and Ephraim were born in Egypt. After burying his father, Joseph returned to Egypt and continued to dwell there with his family.</data>
  <data key="d9">administers,administration,birthplace,governance,land acquisition,location,residence,return,rule,rules,settlement,transport</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-044&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-048&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-050&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-054</data>
  <data key="d11">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1790121441</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Egypt" target="Pharaoh">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Pharaoh is identified as the king of Egypt.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharaoh rules Egypt and delegates authority over the land to Joseph.&lt;SEP&gt;The land of Egypt became Pharaoh's, and Pharaoh received a fifth of its agricultural increase.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharaoh governs Egypt and offers Joseph's family the good of the land during the famine.</data>
  <data key="d9">delegates authority,kingship,ownership,provision,rule,rules,taxation</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-043&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-048&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-051</data>
