  <data key="d8">Sarah is promised to bear Isaac.&lt;SEP&gt;Isaac was promised as Sarah's son.&lt;SEP&gt;Sarah bears Isaac to Abraham.&lt;SEP&gt;Sarah identifies Isaac as her son and rejects Hagar's son as heir with Isaac.</data>
