<edge source="Rebekah" target="Jacob">
  <data key="d7">7.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rebekah dresses Jacob in Esau's raiment, covers Jacob with goat skins, and supplies the food for Jacob's deception.&lt;SEP&gt;Rebekah is Jacob's mother and loved Jacob.&lt;SEP&gt;Jacob is one of the boys born to Rebekah.&lt;SEP&gt;Rebekah identified Jacob as her son and instructed him to obtain goat kids for savory meat.&lt;SEP&gt;Rebekah used Esau's raiment and goat skins to make Jacob resemble Esau before Isaac.&lt;SEP&gt;Rebekah warns Jacob about Esau's intention to kill Jacob and sends Jacob to Laban for safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Jacob identified himself to Rachel as Rebekah's son.</data>
  <data key="d9">affection,assisted disguise,blessing scheme,disguise,family,instruction,mother and son,motherhood,parent,parent-child,parentage,protection,warning</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a32a41554714252668fa190ace9e2f6c-chunk-028</data>
  <data key="d11">Book 01        Genesis.md</data>
  <data key="d12">1790121408</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Rebekah" target="Esau">
