  <data key="d8">Rebekah takes Esau's raiment from the household to disguise Jacob.&lt;SEP&gt;Rebekah is Esau's mother.&lt;SEP&gt;Esau is one of the boys born to Rebekah.&lt;SEP&gt;Rebekah is Esau's mother and learns of Esau's plan against Jacob.&lt;SEP&gt;Esau was Rebekah's son.</data>
