<edge source="Joseph's Brethren" target="Joseph">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Joseph recognized his brethren in Egypt, while his brethren did not recognize Joseph.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph's brethren bowed before Joseph with their faces to the earth.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph required his brethren to bring their youngest brother to Egypt before they could leave.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph accused his brethren of being spies and questioned their stated purpose in Egypt.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph reveals his identity to his brethren, who had previously sold Joseph into Egypt, and later embraces and speaks with them.</data>
