  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rachel conceived and bore Joseph to Jacob.&lt;SEP&gt;Rachel conceives and bears Joseph and gives Joseph his name.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph was a son of Rachel.&lt;SEP&gt;Rachel is Joseph's mother.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph was a son of Rachel and Jacob.</data>
