  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Rachel gave birth to Benjamin and died during the childbirth.&lt;SEP&gt;Rachel is Benjamin's mother.&lt;SEP&gt;Benjamin was a son of Rachel and Jacob.</data>
