  <data key="d8">Jacob was Benjamin's father and changed Benjamin's name from Benoni.&lt;SEP&gt;Jacob was Benjamin's father and kept Benjamin from traveling to Egypt.&lt;SEP&gt;Jacob is Benjamin's father.&lt;SEP&gt;Benjamin was a son of Jacob.&lt;SEP&gt;Jacob portrays Benjamin as a wolf who devours prey and divides spoil.</data>
