<edge source="Israel" target="Joseph">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Israel was Joseph's father and loved Joseph more than the other children.&lt;SEP&gt;Israel's sons travel to Joseph and present Israel's concerns and requests before him.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph asks the men whether their father Israel is well and still alive.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph commands his physician servants to embalm Israel.&lt;SEP&gt;Israel is identified as Joseph's father when Joseph brings Ephraim and Manasseh before him.</data>
