<edge source="Joseph" target="Benjamin">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Joseph requires Benjamin to be brought to him before the brothers can receive further confirmation and assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph recognizes Benjamin as his younger brother and expresses deep affection for him.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph's brethren identified Benjamin as their youngest brother.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph hosts Benjamin with his brothers, gives Benjamin a portion five times larger than the other portions, and declares Benjamin liable when the silver cup is found in Benjamin's sack.&lt;SEP&gt;Joseph and Benjamin are brothers who embrace and weep together after Joseph reveals his identity.</data>
  <data key="d9">accusation,affection,brotherhood,brothers,condition,family,hospitality,identification,recognition,summons</data>
